ic atmosphere.\n\n4. 风景 | Landscape\n\n中文： 唯美的自然风景，夕阳余晖洒在群山和湖泊之间，色彩柔和且富有层次，画面富含浪漫与宁静的美学气息。\nEnglish: A poetic natural landscape at sunset, warm light spilling over mountains and lakes, soft and layered colors, evoking a romantic and tranquil aesthetic mood.\n\n5. 国风 | Chinese Aesthetic (Guofeng)\n\n中文： 古风意境画面，身着汉服的女子立于山水之间，水墨氤氲，色彩淡雅，画面空灵唯美，充满东方美学气质。\nEnglish: Traditional Chinese-style scene, a woman in hanfu standing amid mountains and rivers, ink-like mist drifting, subtle and elegant colors, ethereal and refined, embodying Eastern aesthetics.\n\n6. 城市街道 | City Street\n\n中文： 夜晚的城市街道摄影，霓虹灯倒映在雨后的地面，构图精致，色彩对比强烈却和谐，营造出现代都市的美学氛围。\nEnglish: Nighttime city street photography, neon lights reflected on the wet pavement, precise composition, strong yet harmonious color contrasts, creating a modern urban aesthetic atmosphere.\n\n7. 朋克 | Punk\n\n中文： 赛博朋克风格的城市肖像，霓虹灯光打在人物脸上，冷暖色对比，金属质感与未来感交织，充满张扬的美学冲击。\nEnglish: Cyberpunk-style urban portrait, neon lights casting dramatic reflections on the subject’s face, striking cold–warm color contrast, metallic textures and futuristic mood, delivering bold aesthetic impact.\n\n8. 水彩画风格 | Watercolor Style\n\n中文： 梦幻水彩画风格的森林与湖泊，笔触自由，色彩柔和流动，构图浪漫，呈现出艺术感十足的美学效果。\nEnglish: Dreamlike watercolor-style painting of a forest and lake, free brushstrokes, soft and flowing colors, romantic composition, full of artistic aesthetic expression.\n\n9. 插画风格 | Illustration Style\n\n中文： 唯美插画风格的童话场景，小女孩在花丛中读书，色彩清新明快，细节丰富，画面具有温柔的美学氛围。\nEnglish: A beautiful illustration of a fairytale scene, a little girl reading among flowers, bright and fresh colors, rich details, and a tender, aesthetic atmosphere.\n\n10. 大师级别的照片 | Master-Level Photography\n\n中文： 大师级摄影作品，一名舞者在剧院中央旋转，灯光打下形成戏剧性的光影效果，构图完美，整体氛围高雅而富有艺术美感。\nEnglish: A master-level photograph of a dancer spinning in the center of a theater, dramatic stage lighting creating striking shadows, perfect composition, an elegant atmosphere with artistic aesthetics."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcol